                  class="text-emerald-950">Changes take effect from the next billing cycle</strong
                >, with no penalty and no admin fee. If your child's progress accelerates and you
                want to add sessions, or if life gets busier and you need to reduce frequency, one
                message to us handles it completely.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details
              class="group bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-6 font-semibold text-emerald-950 text-[17px]"
              >
                What exactly is covered by the make-up guarantee?
                <span
                  class="transition group-open:rotate-180 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 p-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <span set:html={Icons.chevronDown} />
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-emerald-800 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed px-6 pb-6">
                Every session your child misses, for any reason, has a guaranteed replacement. <strong
                  class="text-emerald-950"
                  >There are no limits, no exclusions, and no "only applies if you give 24 hours'
                  notice" clauses</strong
                >. Your child is ill on the day? Make-up scheduled. Family travel? Make-up
                scheduled. Teacher unavailable? Make-up scheduled, and we tell you in advance. The
                replacement is booked within the same calendar week where possible, or the following
                week for late notice.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details
              class="group bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-6 font-semibold text-emerald-950 text-[17px]"
              >
                What happens if I want to cancel?
                <span
                  class="transition group-open:rotate-180 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 p-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <span set:html={Icons.chevronDown} />
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-emerald-800 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed px-6 pb-6">
                Cancel before your next billing date and you will not be charged. <strong
                  class="text-emerald-950"
                  >No notice period. No cancellation fee. No lock-in.</strong
                > Send us one message (WhatsApp, email, or through the parent dashboard) and we confirm
                the cancellation immediately. If you are on an annual plan and cancel mid-year, we refund
                the remaining months pro-rata without question.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details
              class="group bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-6 font-semibold text-emerald-950 text-[17px]"
              >
                Are there any fees not listed on this page?
                <span
                  class="transition group-open:rotate-180 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 p-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <span set:html={Icons.chevronDown} />
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-emerald-800 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed px-6 pb-6">
                No. The price you see on this page is the price you pay. <strong
                  class="text-emerald-950"
                  >No setup fee. No resource fee. No platform access charge. No "teacher matching"
                  fee.</strong
                > We have listed every cost component on this page deliberately, because we find it frustrating
                when pricing pages make you feel like you are about to discover something unpleasant at
                checkout. You are not.
              </div>
            </details>

            <details
              class="group bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-6 font-semibold text-emerald-950 text-[17px]"
              >
                Can I pay in my local currency?
                <span
                  class="transition group-open:rotate-180 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 p-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <span set:html={Icons.chevronDown} />
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-emerald-800 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed px-6 pb-6">
                Prices are listed in USD, which is our base currency. <strong
                  class="text-emerald-950"
                  >Your card is charged in USD and your bank applies its standard conversion rate</strong
                >. We do not add a foreign exchange surcharge. Families in the UK, UAE, Canada,
                Australia, and the EU all pay in USD. If you would prefer an invoice in your local
                currency for accounting purposes, contact us and we will arrange it.
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>

  <Footer />

  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
      // --- 1. MAIN FEE CALCULATOR (rebuilt 2026-07-27) ---
      // Pricing data sourced from src/constants/pricing.ts — inlined at build time
      // PRICING[currency][duration_min][sessions_per_week] = monthly base price (USD-derived)
      const PRICING_DATA = {
        USD: {
          '30': { '2': 40, '3': 50, '4': 55, '5': 60 },
          '40': { '2': 56, '3': 66, '4': 73, '5': 80 },
        },
        GBP: {
          '30': { '2': 30, '3': 38, '4': 42, '5': 46 },
          '40': { '2': 40, '3': 50, '4': 56, '5': 61 },
        },
        EUR: {
          '30': { '2': 36, '3': 46, '4': 50, '5': 55 },
          '40': { '2': 48, '3': 61, '4': 66, '5': 73 },
        },
        AED: {
          '30': { '2': 145, '3': 180, '4': 205, '5': 220 },
          '40': { '2': 193, '3': 240, '4': 273, '5': 293 },
        },
        SGD: {
          '30': { '2': 52, '3': 65, '4': 71, '5': 77 },
          '40': { '2': 72, '3': 85, '4': 94, '5': 103 },
        },
        CAD: {
          '30': { '2': 56, '3': 71, '4': 78, '5': 85 },
          '40': { '2': 79, '3': 93, '4': 103, '5': 113 },
        },
        AUD: {
          '30': { '2': 57, '3': 72, '4': 79, '5': 86 },
          '40': { '2': 80, '3': 94, '4': 104, '5': 114 },
        },
        SAR: {
          '30': { '2': 150, '3': 188, '4': 206, '5': 225 },
          '40': { '2': 210, '3': 248, '4': 274, '5': 300 },
        },
      };
      const CURRENCY_SYMBOLS = {
        USD: '$',
        GBP: '£',
        EUR: '€',
        AED: 'د.إ',
        SGD: 'S$',
        CAD: 'C$',
        AUD: 'A$',
        SAR: '﷼',
      };
      const BILLING_DISCOUNTS = { monthly: 0, sixMonth: 0.05, annual: 0.15 };

      const calcState = { who: null, dur: null, sess: null, currency: 'USD', billing: null };

      // Helper: apply selected/deselected class toggling — hover:text-emerald-700 stripped from selected
      function selectCalcBtn(group, clickedBtn) {
        const container = clickedBtn.parentElement;
        container.querySelectorAll('.calc-btn').forEach((b) => {
          if (b.dataset.group !== group) return;
          b.classList.remove('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
          b.classList.add(
            'bg-cream-50',
            'text-emerald-900/70',
            'border-emerald-200',
            'hover:text-emerald-700'
          );
        });
        clickedBtn.classList.remove(
          'bg-cream-50',
          'text-emerald-900/70',
          'border-emerald-200',
          'hover:text-emerald-700'
        );
        clickedBtn.classList.add('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
      }

      // Helper: apply selected/deselected for the lightweight Who toggle (calc-who class)
      function selectWhoBtn(clickedBtn) {
        document.querySelectorAll('.calc-who').forEach((b) => {
          b.classList.remove('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
          b.classList.add(
            'bg-white',
            'text-emerald-900/70',
            'border-emerald-200',
            'hover:text-emerald-700'
          );
        });
        clickedBtn.classList.remove(
          'bg-white',
          'text-emerald-900/70',
          'border-emerald-200',
          'hover:text-emerald-700'
        );
        clickedBtn.classList.add('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
      }

      // Bind Who toggle
      document.querySelectorAll('.calc-who').forEach((btn) => {
        if (btn.dataset.bound) return;
        btn.dataset.bound = 'true';
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          selectWhoBtn(this);
          calcState.who = this.dataset.val;
          const whoVal = document.getElementById('calc-who-val');
          if (whoVal) whoVal.textContent = this.dataset.label;
          // who doesn't affect price — no recalc needed
        });
      });

      // Bind all .calc-btn buttons (dur, sess, billing)
      document.querySelectorAll('.calc-btn').forEach((btn) => {
        if (btn.dataset.bound) return;
        btn.dataset.bound = 'true';
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          const group = this.dataset.group;
          if (!group) return; // safety guard for any non-grouped calc-btn
          selectCalcBtn(group, this);
          calcState[group] = this.dataset.val;
          // Update label display
          const labelMap = {
            dur: 'calc-dur-val',
            sess: 'calc-sess-val',
            billing: 'calc-billing-val',
          };
          const valElem = document.getElementById(labelMap[group]);
          if (valElem) valElem.textContent = this.dataset.label;
          updateCalcResult();
          updateCalcCta();
        });
      });

      // Bind currency select
      const currencySelect = document.getElementById('calc-currency-select');
      if (currencySelect && !currencySelect.dataset.bound) {
        currencySelect.dataset.bound = 'true';
        currencySelect.addEventListener('change', function () {
          calcState.currency = this.value;
          updateCalcResult();
          updateCalcCta();
        });
      }

      function updateCalcResult() {
        if (!calcState.dur || !calcState.sess || !calcState.billing) return;
        const cur = calcState.currency || 'USD';
        const base = PRICING_DATA[cur]?.[calcState.dur]?.[calcState.sess] ?? 0;
        const discount = BILLING_DISCOUNTS[calcState.billing] ?? 0;
        const price = Math.round(base * (1 - discount));
        const sym = CURRENCY_SYMBOLS[cur] ?? cur;
        const sessPerMonth = parseInt(calcState.sess) * 4;
        const perSesh = sessPerMonth > 0 ? (price / sessPerMonth).toFixed(2) : '—';
        const billingLabel =
          calcState.billing === 'annual'
            ? '12-month'
            : calcState.billing === 'sixMonth'
              ? '6-month'
              : 'monthly';
        const totalLine =
          calcState.billing === 'annual'
            ? `<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span class="text-sm text-emerald-800/80 font-medium">Total billed</span><span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-950">${sym}${price * 12}</span></div>`
            : calcState.billing === 'sixMonth'
              ? `<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span class="text-sm text-emerald-800/80 font-medium">Total billed</span><span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-950">${sym}${price * 6}</span></div>`
              : '';
        const savingAmt =
          discount > 0
            ? Math.round(base * discount * (calcState.billing === 'annual' ? 12 : 6))
            : 0;
        const html = `
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><span class="text-sm text-emerald-800/80 font-medium">Sessions / month</span><span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-950">${sessPerMonth} sessions</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span class="text-sm text-emerald-800/80 font-medium">Per session</span><span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-950">${sym}${perSesh}</span></div>
          ${totalLine}
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-emerald-100 flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-[15px] font-bold text-emerald-950">Monthly fee</span>
            <div class="text-right">
              <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-700 leading-none mb-1">${sym}${price}<span class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-800/60">/mo</span></div>
              ${savingAmt > 0 ? `<div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full inline-block">You save ${sym}${savingAmt} on ${billingLabel} plan</div>` : ''}
            </div>
          </div>
        `;
        const box = document.getElementById('calc-result-box');
        if (box) {
          box.innerHTML = html;
          box.classList.remove('bg-emerald-50', 'border-emerald-100');
          box.classList.add('bg-white', 'border-emerald-200', 'shadow-sm');
        }
        // Store final price on state for URL param passthrough
        calcState._price = price;
        calcState._sym = sym;
      }

      function updateCalcCta() {
        // Merge calculator selections into the CTA URL — preserve all existing ad params (gclid, utm_*)
        const base = new URL('/funnel/signup', window.location.origin);
        const existing = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
        existing.forEach((v, k) => base.searchParams.set(k, v));
        if (calcState.who) base.searchParams.set('enrollType', calcState.who);
        if (calcState.dur) base.searchParams.set('duration', calcState.dur);
        if (calcState.sess) base.searchParams.set('sessions', calcState.sess);
        if (calcState.currency) base.searchParams.set('currency', calcState.currency);
        if (calcState.billing) base.searchParams.set('billing', calcState.billing);
        if (calcState._price) base.searchParams.set('price', calcState._price);
        document.querySelectorAll('a[href*="/funnel/signup"]').forEach((a) => {
          a.href = base.toString();
        });
      }

      // --- 2. PRICING GRID (plans section — uses same PRICING_DATA as calculator) ---
      const planState = { dur: '30', currency: 'USD' };

      // Same hover-safe pattern as selectCalcBtn — strips hover:text-emerald-700 from selected
      function selectPlanBtn(group, clickedBtn) {
        const container = clickedBtn.parentElement;
        container.querySelectorAll('.plan-btn').forEach((b) => {
          if (b.dataset.group !== group) return;
          b.classList.remove('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
          b.classList.add(
            'bg-emerald-50',
            'text-emerald-900/70',
            'border-emerald-200',
            'hover:text-emerald-700'
          );
        });
        clickedBtn.classList.remove(
          'bg-emerald-50',
          'text-emerald-900/70',
          'border-emerald-200',
          'hover:text-emerald-700'
        );
        clickedBtn.classList.add('bg-emerald-700', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-700');
      }

      function updatePlanGrid() {
        const cur = planState.currency || 'USD';
        const dur = planState.dur || '30';
        const sym = CURRENCY_SYMBOLS[cur] ?? cur;
        ['2', '3', '4', '5'].forEach((sess) => {
          const price = PRICING_DATA[cur]?.[dur]?.[sess] ?? '—';
          const symEl = document.getElementById(`plan-sym-${sess}`);
          const priceEl = document.getElementById(`plan-price-${sess}`);
          const perEl = document.getElementById(`plan-per-${sess}`);
          if (symEl) symEl.textContent = sym;
          if (priceEl) priceEl.textContent = price;
          if (perEl) perEl.textContent = `per month · ${parseInt(sess) * 4} sessions`;
        });
      }

      // Bind plan duration buttons
      document.querySelectorAll('.plan-btn').forEach((btn) => {
        if (btn.dataset.bound) return;
        btn.dataset.bound = 'true';
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          const group = this.dataset.group;
          if (!group) return;
          selectPlanBtn(group, this);
          planState.dur = this.dataset.val;
          updatePlanGrid();
        });
      });

      // Bind plan currency select
      const planCurrencySelect = document.getElementById('plan-currency-select');
      if (planCurrencySelect && !planCurrencySelect.dataset.bound) {
        planCurrencySelect.dataset.bound = 'true';
        planCurrencySelect.addEventListener('change', function () {
          planState.currency = this.value;
          updatePlanGrid();
        });
      }

      // Default selection on load: 30min, USD — click the 30min button to set selected state
      const planDurDefault = document.querySelector('#plan-dur-btns .plan-btn[data-val="30"]');
      if (planDurDefault) selectPlanBtn('plan-dur', planDurDefault);
      updatePlanGrid();

      // --- 3. BILLING TOGGLE (plans section — preserved unchanged) ---

      let isAnnualPricing = true;
      const planPrices = {
        light: { m: 39, a: 33 },
        standard: { m: 59, a: 50 },
        intensive: { m: 89, a: 76 },
      };

      const billingToggle = document.getElementById('billing-toggle');
      if (billingToggle && !billingToggle.dataset.bound) {
        billingToggle.dataset.bound = 'true';

        billingToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
          isAnnualPricing = !isAnnualPricing;

          const thumb = document.getElementById('billing-thumb');
          const lblAnnual = document.getElementById('lbl-annual');
          const lblMonthly = document.getElementById('lbl-monthly');

          if (isAnnualPricing && thumb && lblAnnual && lblMonthly) {
            billingToggle.classList.replace('bg-emerald-100', 'bg-emerald-700');
            thumb.classList.replace('translate-x-1', 'translate-x-6');
            lblAnnual.classList.replace('text-emerald-900/60', 'text-emerald-950');
            lblMonthly.classList.replace('text-emerald-950', 'text-emerald-900/60');
          } else if (thumb && lblAnnual && lblMonthly) {
            billingToggle.classList.replace('bg-emerald-700', 'bg-emerald-100');
            thumb.classList.replace('translate-x-6', 'translate-x-1');
            lblMonthly.classList.replace('text-emerald-900/60', 'text-emerald-950');
            lblAnnual.classList.replace('text-emerald-950', 'text-emerald-900/60');
          }

          const p = isAnnualPricing ? 'a' : 'm';
          const suf = isAnnualPricing ? 'per month, billed annually' : 'per month, billed monthly';
          const orig = {
            light: isAnnualPricing ? '$39/mo when billed monthly' : '',
            standard: isAnnualPricing ? '$59/mo when billed monthly' : '',
            intensive: isAnnualPricing ? '$89/mo when billed monthly' : '',
          };

          ['light', 'standard', 'intensive'].forEach((id) => {
            const priceEl = document.getElementById(`price-${id}`);
            if (priceEl) priceEl.textContent = planPrices[id][p].toString();

            const perEl = document.getElementById(`per-${id}`);
            if (perEl) perEl.textContent = suf;

            const origEl = document.getElementById(`orig-${id}`);
            if (origEl) {
              if (orig[id]) {
                origEl.textContent = orig[id];
                origEl.classList.remove('invisible');
              } else {
                origEl.classList.add('invisible');
              }
            }
          });
        });
      }

      // --- 3. SIBLING CALCULATOR (preserved unchanged) ---
      const addBtn = document.getElementById('sib-add-btn');
      if (addBtn && !addBtn.dataset.bound) {
        addBtn.dataset.bound = 'true';

        addBtn.addEventListener('click', function addSibling() {
          const row2 = document.getElementById('child2-row');

          if (row2 && row2.classList.contains('hidden')) {
            row2.classList.remove('hidden');
            row2.classList.add('flex');

            const label = document.getElementById('sib-total-label');
            if (label) label.textContent = '2 children enrolled';

            const total = document.getElementById('sib-total-num');
            if (total) total.textContent = '$94';

            const savingBadge = document.getElementById('sib-saving');
            if (savingBadge) {
              savingBadge.classList.remove('hidden');
              savingBadge.classList.add('block');
            }

            addBtn.textContent = 'Contact us for 3+ children →';
            addBtn.onclick = (e) => {
              e.preventDefault();
              window.location.href = 'mailto:hello@quranific.com';
            };
          }
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</Base>
